+## Error model
+
+`requestPurchase` rejects, and the entitlement queries reject, only with `AppPaymentsError` (has a `.code`):
+
+| Code | Meaning |
+|------|---------|
+| `invalid_input` | `contentId` was not a non-negative integer (or a bad option type) |
